{% doc %}
  A card from a card entry (content model part 4): image, title, text, link. Staff don't choose a
  layout: a card with an image is an image card, a card without one is a text card under a rule
  (DESIGN.md §6.5).

  A card with a logo (the Gallery, the Foundation or Artists for Kids) is about that organisation:
  the logo is its heading, the title stays for screen readers, and the card takes the
  organisation's colours for its rule and link (DS-50).

  The link: with no label of its own, the whole card links through its title (on a logo card, the
  logo links); with a label, the label shows as a standalone link under the text. Off-site
  addresses get the external cue.

  A card whose link is a PDF (a learning guide, a lesson plan) is a document: its image, the
  cover, shows whole on the mat, as a document tile does, and the link says "(PDF)" (DS-69). The
  mat keeps the card's 4:3, so its title lines up with the photo cards beside it.

  @param {object} card - A card entry
  @param {string} [heading] - Heading element for the title: 'h2' or 'h3' (default)
  @param {boolean} [portrait] - A card in a group of portraits (people): 4:5 image, compact title
  @param {boolean} [compact] - A card in a shelf of documents: compact title (DS-75)
  @param {string} [sizes] - The picture's sizes when the group's layout isn't three across (four
    across, the wide first cards, a shelf, a row), so the browser fetches the right width

  The picture has no alt text of its own unless Files gives it one: the card's title follows it,
  so repeating the title would say it twice (as heroes, DS-58).

  @example
  {%- render 'gs-card', card: card -%}
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign tag = heading | default: 'h3'
  assign image = card.image.value
  assign link = card.link.value
  assign stretch = false
  assign labelled = false
  assign is_pdf = false
  if link.url != blank
    capture r
      render 'gs-url', link: link
    endcapture
    assign r = r | strip | split: '|'
    if r[2] == '1'
      assign is_pdf = true
    endif
    if link.text == blank
      assign stretch = true
    else
      assign labelled = true
    endif
  endif
  assign brand = ''
  if card.logo.value != blank
    capture brand
      render 'gs-programme', value: card.logo.value
    endcapture
    assign brand = brand | strip
  endif
-%}
{%- if brand != blank -%}
  {%- liquid
    # The full lockups: a card names the organisation in full (DESIGN.md §8.2).
    case brand
      when 'foundation'
        assign logo = 'foundation-full-colour-box'
      when 'artists-for-kids'
        assign logo = 'artists-for-kids-full-colour-box'
      else
        assign logo = 'gallery-full-stacked-colour-box'
    endcase
  -%}
  <article class="gs-card gs-card--logo" data-gs-brand="{{ brand }}">
    <{{ tag }} class="gs-card__logo gs-card__logo--{{ brand }}">
      {%- if stretch -%}
        <a href="{{ r[0] }}">
          <span class="gs-visually-hidden">{{ card.title.value | escape }}{% if r[1] == '1' %} {{ 'general.external_site' | t }}{% endif %}</span>
          {%- render 'gs-logo', name: logo, label: 'decorative' -%}
        </a>
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="gs-visually-hidden">{{ card.title.value | escape }}</span>
        {%- render 'gs-logo', name: logo, label: 'decorative' -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </{{ tag }}>
    <div class="gs-card__body">
      {%- if card.text.value != blank -%}
        <div class="gs-card__text">{%- render 'gs-paragraphs', text: card.text.value -%}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if labelled -%}
        {%- render 'gs-link', link: link, class: 'gs-cta-link' -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </article>
{%- else -%}
  <article class="gs-card{% if image == blank %} gs-card--text{% endif %}{% if portrait or compact %} gs-card--compact{% endif %}">
    {%- if image != blank -%}
      {%- if portrait -%}
        {%- render 'gs-media', image: image, preset: 'tile', mode: 'photo', ratio: 'var(--gs-ratio-portrait)', sizes: sizes -%}
      {%- elsif is_pdf -%}
        {%- render 'gs-media', image: image, preset: 'card', mode: 'artwork', ratio: 'var(--gs-ratio-card)', sizes: sizes -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- render 'gs-media', image: image, preset: 'card', mode: 'photo', sizes: sizes -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    <{{ tag }} class="gs-card__title">
      {%- if stretch -%}
        {%- render 'gs-link', link: link, label: card.title.value, cue_wraps: true -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {{- card.title.value | escape | replace: ' - ', '&nbsp;- ' | replace: ' | ', '&nbsp;| ' -}}
      {%- endif -%}
    </{{ tag }}>
    {%- if card.text.value != blank -%}
      <div class="gs-card__text">{%- render 'gs-paragraphs', text: card.text.value -%}</div>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if labelled -%}
      {%- render 'gs-link', link: link, class: 'gs-cta-link' -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </article>
{%- endif -%}
